  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "CHARACTER ARC\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 7, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Arc stage\n   2 Role in the scene (short list)\n   3 Role in the scene\n   4 Which way they change\n   5 The lie they believe\n   6 The old wound\n   7 Fighting the change\n   8 The test\n   9 Slipping back\n  10 How the change shows\n  11 A mentor's lesson\n  12 The character they could become\n  13 The moment they see it\n  14 Giving it up\n  15 The first small step\n  16 Changing for show\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 7, CC 81 to 96\n   1 Others notice the change\n   2 Chasing a new goal\n   3 A promise to themself\n   4 Changed, but too late\n   5 The healer\n   6 Facing feelings instead of running\n   7 Picturing the best and the worst\n   8 Welcoming hard feelings\n   9 Depth of awareness\n  10 The healing arc\n  11 My older sibling is the coolest person on the planet\n  12 You can always break the rules and do the impossible\n  13 What cool looks like in a grown-up\n  14 suite: Ends better than they began\n  15 suite: The fall\n  16 suite: The steady one\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 7, CC 97 to 112\n   1 suite: Refuses to change\n   2 suite: The mirror ending\n   3 suite: Mentor at their best\n   4 suite: The mentor's road\n   5 suite: Dark mirror\n   6 suite: Small steps\n   7 suite: The act that became real\n   8 suite: The lesson passed on\n   9 suite: The psychologist\n  10 suite: The hippie healer\n  11 suite: The enlightened businessman\n  12 suite: Loving the storm\n  13 suite: Growing-up moments\n  14 suite: Coming of age\n  15 pair: When the lie is exposed, the crisis comes\n  16 pair: When the old wound is touched, they fight the change harder\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 8, CC 1 to 16\n   1 pair: When the test is passed, the change shows\n   2 pair: When they slip back, their road drops\n   3 pair: When they fight the change with jokes, the laughs rise\n   4 pair: When the change comes, the posture opens\n   5 pair: When a character becomes the spark in a scene, the plot takes a turn\n   6 pair: When someone is set up as the lead's opposite, the lead's flaw becomes obvious\n   7 pair: When a character is growing, the change starts to show on the outside\n   8 pair: When a character is falling, they slip back into old habits\n   9 pair: When the lesson comes back at the key moment, the test is passed\n  10 pair: When the mentor dies, grief follows\n  11 pair: When the hero sees themself in the mirror character, they understand\n  12 pair: When the mirror character clashes harder, the hero fights the change\n  13 pair: When they see it, they give something up\n  14 pair: When they give it up, the change shows\n  15 pair: When the lie grips harder, they cannot see the truth\n  16 pair: When a character sees the truth, the background stretches\nCV-CC 5: MIDI channel 8, CC 17 to 32\n   1 pair: When they finally see it, the clothes change\n   2 pair: When the old wound is deeper, the promise to themself is stronger\n   3 pair: When they take a brave first step, hope rises\n   4 pair: When they step back after the first step, they slip\n   5 pair: When the change is only for show, a test comes\n   6 pair: When others notice, the change shows more\n   7 pair: When others pull them back, they slip\n   8 pair: When winning feels empty, they see it\n   9 pair: When they break the promise for good reason, there is no going back\n  10 pair: When the change comes too late, grief deepens\n  11 pair: When a healer is near, they stay with the feeling\n  12 pair: When they run from a feeling, the cost climbs\n  13 pair: When they picture both outcomes, the fear loosens\n  14 pair: When they stay with the feeling, they start to welcome it\n  15 pair: When they welcome hard feelings, awareness deepens\n  16 pair: When awareness deepens, they give more\nCV-CC 6: MIDI channel 8, CC 33 to 48\n   1 pair: When the healing moves forward, the inner voice softens\n   2 pair: When they're free, they become the healer\n   3 pair: When they face the feeling, the way they cope with shame changes\n   4 pair: When they feel a hard feeling all the way through, freedom is on the other side\n   5 pair: When they feel a hard feeling all the way through, the storm inside settles\n   6 pair: When they feel a hard feeling all the way through, awareness deepens\n   7 pair: When they take care of their own body and mind, they have more to give\n   8 pair: When they stop caring for themselves, they have less to give\n   9 pair: When they help others, life has meaning\n  10 pair: When the sibling becomes a hero, the kid learns rules can break\n  11 pair: When rules feel breakable, they get reckless\n  12 pair: When a cool grown-up teaches, a lesson is passed on\n  13 pair: When they leave the place they always came back to, they grow up a little\n  14 pairs: The arc engine\n  15 pairs: Finally seeing\n  16 pairs: Changing for real\nCV-CC 7: MIDI channel 8, CC 49 to 52\n   1 pairs: The other side\n   2 pairs: The healing road\n   3 pairs: The clipboard chase\n   4 pairs: Coming of age: the moves"
   },
